{"strongs": "H2201", "word": "זְעָקָה", "translit": "ze.a.qah", "root": "זעק", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "cry, outcry", "definition": "זְעָקָה noun feminine cry, outcry , absolute ׳ ז Jer 18:22 + 5 t.; construct זַעֲקַת Gen 18:20 + 3 t.; suffix זַעֲקָתִי Job 16:18 זַעֲקָתָם Isa 15:5 + 3 t.; — 1. outcry , against, זַעֲקַת ׳ סְדֹם וגו Gen 18:20 ( J ). 2. cry of distress , concerning something זַעֲקַתשֶֿׁבֶר Isa 15:5 (object of יְעֹעֵ֑רוּ ; compare בִּבְכִי in prev. clause); absolute v Isa 15:8 (subject of הִקִּיפָה , || יְלָלָה ); Jer 18:22 ( ׳ תִּשָּׁמַע ז ), Jer 20:16 ; Jer 48:4 ; Jer 50:46 ; Neh 5:6 ; Neh 9:9 (all with שׁמע ), Jer 48:34 (jointed with נתן קול ), Job 16:18 ; Esth 9:31 (lamentation), compare Esth 4:1 ( גְּדוֺלָה וּמָרָה ׳ ז , accusative of congnate meaning with verb with זעק ); specifically זעקתדָּֿ֑ל Prov 21:13 cry of poor ; ׳ קול ז Isa 65:19 (|| קול בכי ), Jer 51:54 ; Ezek 27:28 . 3. outcry, clamour זעקת מושׁל בַּכְּסִילִים Eccl 9:17 (opposed to דברי חכמים בְּנַחַת נשׁמעים ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2423')\">BDB2423</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2201')\">H2201</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2422')\">BDB2422</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2424')\">BDB2424</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>זְעָקָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>cry, outcry</highlightword>, absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 18:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,22)\">Jer 18:22</ref> + 5 t.; construct <bdbheb>זַעֲקַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 18:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,20)\">Gen 18:20</ref> + 3 t.; suffix <bdbheb>זַעֲקָתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 16:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,16,18)\">Job 16:18</ref> <bdbheb>זַעֲקָתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 15:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5